title: The regional presidents
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_party
view-if: barons_timer <= 0 and sanchez_leader = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; barons_timer = 2

= The regional presidents

Susana Díaz in Andalusia, Emiliano García-Page in Castilla-La Mancha, Guillermo Fernández Vara in Extremadura, Javier Lambán in Aragón, Ximo Puig in Valencia, Javier Fernández in Asturias: each governs, each has their own electorate, and each has a view on what you should do in Madrid.

- @convene: Convene the regional presidents before deciding anything
- @executive: Consult the Federal Executive first
- @announce: Announce your strategy, then inform them
- @formal_role: Offer the barons a formal role in the negotiations
- @easy_discard

@convene
on-arrival: regional_leaders_dissent -= 8; sanchez_authority -= 2; federal_committee_balance += 3

The meeting runs for five hours. You leave with their grudging support and the feeling that you now need their permission.

@executive
on-arrival: institutionalists_dissent -= 5; modernisers_dissent -= 3; regional_leaders_dissent += 4; federal_executive_backing = 1

Your executive backs you. The barons note that they were not asked.

@announce
on-arrival: sanchez_authority += 5; member_morale += 3; regional_leaders_dissent += 12; federal_committee_balance -= 5

You set the line on television. In Seville, the reaction is icy.

@formal_role
on-arrival: regional_leaders_dissent -= 15; regional_leaders_strength += 4; sanchez_authority -= 6; barons_veto = 1

The barons join the negotiating structure. Nothing will be signed without them, which reassures them and limits you.

@membership
title: Ask the members
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_party
view-if: (pact_cs = 1 or pact_up = 1) and membership_round < formation_round and membership_timer <= 0 and sanchez_leader = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.membership_timer = 2; Q.membership_round = Q.formation_round || 1; !}

= Ask the members

An agreement has been signed. You could put it to a vote of the whole membership, something the PSOE has never done, before the Federal Committee can bury it.

- @consult: Hold the consultation
- @easy_discard

@consult
on-arrival: member_morale += 8; sanchez_authority += 6; sanchismo += 5; regional_leaders_dissent += 3; federal_committee_balance += 4

The members back the agreement by a wide margin. The barons cannot argue with the result; they argue instead about the question.
